<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westamerica Bancorp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westamerica Bancorp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it upgraded Westamerica Bancorp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.  </p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown later said it raised the 1998 earnings estimate to $5.25 a share from $5.20 a share. Said left the 1997 estimate unchanged at $4.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a new six-to-12 month price target of $74 a share. The prior price target was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
